Proprietary firmware
--------------------

Firmware images built from this system contain binary blobs that are NOT
covered by this repository's licenses and may not be redistributable. The
package below sets RUBIK_PI3_FIRMWARE_REDISTRIBUTE = NO, so Buildroot's
legal-info lists its license texts but does not include its sources.

* package/rubik-pi3-firmware
  - Qualcomm Hexagon CDSP/ADSP firmware and fastrpc shells/skels
    (linux-msm/hexagon-dsp-binaries and linux-firmware; Qualcomm firmware
    license, with MIT-licensed pieces).
  - Adreno, Venus and QUP firmware from linux-firmware (Qualcomm firmware
    license).
  - AMPAK AP6256 (Broadcom/Cypress BCM43456) WiFi firmware, NVRAM and the
    BCM4345C5 Bluetooth patchram, from rubikpi-ai/rubikpi3-firmware and
    armbian/firmware (Broadcom bcm43xx firmware license).

Not shipped: the Renesas uPD720201 USB controller firmware. Every board
carries it in the `usb_fw` partition of its UFS boot LUNs, and
/usr/sbin/rubik-usb-fw points the kernel firmware loader there at boot.

Not shipped: the Qualcomm AI Runtime (QAIRT). Applications provision it
themselves.

Before distributing firmware built from this system, review the license
files that `mix nerves.artifact` / Buildroot `legal-info` collects.
